.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-INSPECT 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-inspect
.Nd show what a capsule says, without checking it
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis inspect
.Op Fl j | Fl -json
.Ar dir
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis inspect
reads the seal
.Pa noqtis.sig
and the manifest
.Pa noqtis.json
of the capsule
.Ar dir
.Pq Xr noqtis-capsule 5
with the same strict readers as
.Xr noqtis-check 1
and prints what they say:
.Bl -tag -width timestamp
.It format
the manifest's format,
.Ql noqtis-capsule-1
.It alg
the seal's signature algorithm
.It key
the SHA-256 of the seal's public key, in hex: the key's fingerprint
.It created
the manifest's creation time (RFC 3339, UTC)
.It files
the number of files the manifest lists
.It bytes
their total size
.It timestamp
.Ql present
when the seal carries an RFC 3161 timestamp,
.Ql none
otherwise
.It meta
the manifest's
.Ql meta
object (canonical JSON), when it has one
.El
.Pp
Nothing is checked: not the manifest's digest, the signature, the
timestamp or any file.
The last line says so; run
.Xr noqtis-check 1
to check the capsule.
When the seal or the manifest does not parse, the failing rows are
printed as by
.Xr noqtis-check 1 .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl j , Fl -json
Print one line of JSON instead:
.Bd -literal
{"capsule":"<dir>","checked":false,"format":"<format>","alg":"<alg>",
 "key_sha256":"<hex>","created":"<time>","files":<n>,"bytes":<n>,
 "timestamp":<bool>,"meta":<object or null>}
.Ed
.Pp
or, when the capsule cannot be read,
.Bd -literal
{"capsule":"<dir>","checked":false,
 "errors":[{"check":"<name>","detail":"<text>"},...]}
.Ed
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
the seal and the manifest parse (nothing is checked)
.It 1
one of them does not parse
.It 2
a usage error, or the path is not a folder
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis inspect results
format     noqtis-capsule-1
alg        ML-DSA-65
key        da278e20d47d35382abfa1c10352e1800c33fb5b1a2b725fc24ef18200b41ef7
created    2026-10-29T14:59:18Z
files      2
bytes      6
timestamp  none
meta       {"project":"demo"}
results: read, not checked (run `noqtis check` to check it)
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-check 1 ,
.Xr noqtis-seal 1 ,
.Xr nqinsp 3 ,
.Xr noqtis-capsule 5
